  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a tandoor clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and ginger and sauté for another minute.",
    "Add fermented black beans, mustard seeds, curry powder, salt, and black pepper, and sauté for 2 minutes.",
    "Add water and bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in lime juice and season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh cilantro.",
    "Let cool slightly before serving.",
    "Serve over rice or with naan bread.",
    "Garnish with extra cilantro if desired."
